    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the starship mechanic role and pay the immense debt your father left you with. Upgrade your workshop, craft components, build starships, complete contracts for factions, read the events with newspaper, and most importantly, pay the debt before the deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/c0b6869cf419331802af97275a2c2d35.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.poster.avif?t=1732636125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.webm?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.mp4?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your way from basic items to advanced starship components. Unlock new blueprints to assemble increasingly advanced starships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/8352b8bbb1b6f168fd116d1993151dd1.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7c62cf1eb6b04e662511eaf70188838a.poster.avif?t=1732636125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7c62cf1eb6b04e662511eaf70188838a.webm?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7c62cf1eb6b04e662511eaf70188838a.mp4?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete contracts to earn money, build relationships with the various factions and unlock faction perks. As you progress, your reputation as a skilled starship mechanic grows, opening up new opportunities and challenges. The contracts you take on shape your journey, providing rewards and deepening connections with key factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/99ed02b950703b920fb494af8e7aaea8.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/6903434bc19804276b56ce6b924064c7.poster.avif?t=1732636125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/6903434bc19804276b56ce6b924064c7.webm?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/6903434bc19804276b56ce6b924064c7.mp4?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new item and starship blueprints as you advance. Upgrade your workshop and machines to take on more complex projects and increase your standing as a top-tier mechanic in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/592061bc28c3e85e3768dc60a6262496.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/e44f30cce8060b7926a09abdd26cf3a6.poster.avif?t=1732636125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/e44f30cce8060b7926a09abdd26cf3a6.webm?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/e44f30cce8060b7926a09abdd26cf3a6.mp4?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay informed by reading the daily newspaper, uncovering the latest events shaping the galaxy. Discover how these events influence market prices, from items and starships to valuable blueprints,\u00a0and dive deeper into the unfolding galactic narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the starship mechanic role and pay the immense debt your father left you with. Upgrade your workshop, craft components, build starships, complete contracts for factions, read the events with newspaper, and most importantly, pay the debt before the deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/c0b6869cf419331802af97275a2c2d35.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.poster.avif?t=1732636125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.webm?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/7051dfd52d52163a28fc2b570b955a9c.mp4?t=1732636125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your way from basic items to advanced starship components. Unlock new blueprints to assemble increasingly advanced starships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431590/extras/8352b8bbb1b6f168fd116d1993151dd1.avif?t=1732636125\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl